-- L4DEL: title: Whether a line consists of a comment, along with any surrounding whitespace
-- L4DEL: intuition: Whether a line consists of a comment, along with any surrounding whitespace.

@file book/TPiL/Examples.lean
@decl TPiL.isMessageCommentLine
-- L4DEL: title: Whether a line is a comment that introduces a message
-- L4DEL: intuition: Whether a line is a comment that introduces a message.

